## PROJECT OVERVIEW

JARVIS is a voice-only AI executive assistant prototype for a Mercedes-Benz CEO.
It listens for the wake word "Hey Jarvis" (on-device, no cloud), processes natural
language voice queries, fetches structured data from PostgreSQL, and speaks the
answer aloud — all within ~2 seconds end-to-end.

**Current version:** 2.0.0 (as of 2026-10-13)
**LLM:** Groq `openai/gpt-oss-120b` (1000 RPM, no daily limit — switched from Gemini)
**All 22/22 tests passing** (17 unit + 5 live integration), 0.9–3.5s response time

