## ARCHITECTURE

```
[Android Phone]
  │  Wake word: "Hey Jarvis" — Sherpa-ONNX KWS (Apache 2.0, on-device)
  │  STT: expo-speech-recognition (Google on-device, real live transcription)
  ▼
[React Native 0.76.9 / Expo 52 bare workflow — v2.0.0 UI]
  │  expo-speech (TTS) ◄──────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │  Sherpa-ONNX wake word + react-native-audio-record             │
  │  react-native-background-actions (Foreground Service)          │
  │  PrecisionRing (AMG instrument cluster animation)              │
  │  SuggestionChips (tappable follow-up suggestions)              │
  │                                                                 │
  │  WebSocket wss://utilsnow.com/jarvis/ws                        │
  ▼                                                                 │
[nginx on VPS 200.141.2.221] ──► 127.0.0.1:8001 (Docker)          │
  │                                                                 │
  ▼                                                                 │
[FastAPI Backend v2.0.0 — Python 3.12, Docker jarvis-backend-1]    │
  │  LangGraph StateGraph                                           │
  │  Groq openai/gpt-oss-120b (primary LLM)                       │
  │  Gemini gemini-3.5-flash (fallback if GROQ_API_KEY blank)      │
  │  Keyword heuristic (fallback if both LLMs fail)                │
  │  asyncpg (PostgreSQL connection pool)                           │
  │  Session context: _sessions dict[str,deque] maxlen=5           │
  ▼                                                                 │
[PostgreSQL 16 + pgvector — Docker jarvis-db-1]                    │
  │  8 tables: people, meetings, meeting_attendees,                 │
  │            action_items, relationships, meeting_chunks,         │
  │            agenda_files (new v2.0)                             │
  │  HNSW vector index (1536-dim)                                   │
  │  13 people (2 marked is_board_member=true), 21 meetings,        │
  │  20 action items                                                │
  └───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────-┘
```

## WEBSOCKET PROTOCOL (v2)

- IN:  `{"type": "query", "text": "..."}` — send a user query
- IN:  `{"type": "ping"}` — keepalive
- OUT: `{"type": "response", "text": "...", "suggestions": ["...", "...", "...", "..."]}` — answer + 3–4 follow-ups
- OUT: `{"type": "pong"}` — response to ping

Suggestions are generated server-side by the template engine (see supervisor.py).
Session context (last 5 turns) is maintained per WS connection in `_sessions`.

