## SUPERVISOR V2 (backend/app/agents/supervisor.py)

LangGraph graph: classify_intent → [agent nodes] → compose_response → generate_suggestions → END

JarvisState fields (v2 additions):
  - `suggestions: list[str]` — 3–4 follow-up chips
  - `data_source: str` — 'live_calendar' | 'agenda_file' | 'database' | etc.
  - `subject_person: str` — person entity extracted from query
  - `session_context: list[dict]` — last N turns from _sessions deque

Key functions:
  - `_people_names_cache: set[str]` — loaded at startup from DB via `_load_people_cache()`
  - `class _SafeMap(dict)` — `__missing__` returns "" so `str.format_map()` never raises KeyError
  - `_SUGGESTION_TEMPLATES: dict` — keyed by 6 intents + "general"; each has 4–6 templates
    with `{person}` and `{meeting}` placeholders
  - `_extract_entities(query, agent_result) -> dict` — extracts person (longest-first match
    from cache) and meeting title via regex:
    `r"- \d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}(?:\s+\d{2}:\d{2})?[^a-zA-Z]*(?::\s*|\s*\|\s*)([^\n(|:]{3,})"`
  - `_generate_suggestions_from_state(intent, query, agent_result, session_context) -> list[str]`
    Fills templates, filters malformed (double-space, trailing preposition, unfilled {slot}),
    pads to 4 with generic fallbacks. Falls back to session_context for entity inheritance.
  - `run_query(query, session_context=None) -> dict` — returns {response, suggestions, intent}

BUG FIXES in v2:
  - Added `overdue` to heuristic-only classify_intent branch (was only in LLM fallback branch)
  - Meeting-title regex now handles both ':' and '|' separators; skips HH:MM time component

## PRECISIONRING (frontend/src/components/PrecisionRing.tsx)

AMG instrument cluster ring using react-native-svg.
  - `AnimatedCircle = Animated.createAnimatedComponent(Circle)` (NOT Animated.View inside Svg)
  - `strokeDashoffset` animated via `Animated.Value` per micState:
    - idle: 97% hidden (3% arc shown at 6-o'clock position)
    - listening: 83% shown (17% hidden)
    - processing/speaking: full circle (0% hidden)
  - 12 tick marks at clock positions (TICK_ANGLES), quarter marks longer/thicker
  - Outer chassis ring: platinum (#B8C2CC), 0.5px stroke, static
  - Gold progress arc: #C9A84C, 1.2px stroke, animated
  - Inner breathing glow: goldGlow background, scale 0.97↔1.025 on listening/speaking
  - Container: 220×220 in VoiceScreen, MicButton absolutely centered inside

