## AGENDA ROUTER (backend/app/routers/agenda.py)

POST /api/agenda/upload
  Form fields: person_name (str), file (UploadFile — PDF/DOCX/JSON)
  - Accepts board member agenda files for calendar fallback
  - `_get_pool_safe()` — returns None instead of raising if pool not initialized
  - PDF: `pypdf.PdfReader` → raw text → `_llm_extract_slots()` (Groq/Gemini)
  - DOCX: `docx.Document` → paragraph text → `_llm_extract_slots()`
  - JSON: direct parse of `[{title, date, time, attendees, summary}]`
  - Resolves person by `ILIKE` with `ORDER BY is_board_member DESC NULLS LAST`
  - Stores metadata in `agenda_files` table
  - Inserts each slot as `meeting_chunks` with `chunk_source='agenda'`,
    `agenda_person_id=person_id`, `meeting_id=NULL`
  - Returns: `{ok, person, person_id, file_type, slots_extracted, chunks_inserted, message}`

## DATABASE SCHEMA V2

```sql
-- Original 6 tables (unchanged):
meetings(id, title, meeting_date, duration_minutes, meeting_type, location,
         summary, attendees jsonb, action_items_count)
people(id, name, role, company, relationship_type, email, phone, notes,
       is_board_member BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE)   -- NEW v2.0 column
meeting_attendees(id, meeting_id, person_id, role)
action_items(id, meeting_id, description, assignee_id, due_date, priority,
             status, created_at)
relationships(id, person_id_a, person_id_b, relationship_type, strength,
              context, last_interaction)
meeting_chunks(id, meeting_id, speaker, content, timestamp_offset,
               chunk_index, embedding vector(1536),
               chunk_source TEXT DEFAULT 'transcript',  -- NEW v2.0: 'transcript'|'agenda'
               agenda_person_id UUID REFERENCES people(id))  -- NEW v2.0

-- New v2.0 table:
agenda_files(id UUID, person_id UUID REFERENCES people(id),
             filename TEXT, file_type TEXT CHECK IN ('pdf','docx','json'),
             raw_text TEXT, uploaded_at TIMESTAMPTZ)
```

HNSW index on `meeting_chunks.embedding` for fast semantic search.
Critical: use `meetings.meeting_date` (NOT start_time), `action_items.assignee_id` (NOT owner_id).
Board members: 2 people marked `is_board_member=true` after running agenda_migration.sql.

