## SAMPLE QUERIES AND EXPECTED RESPONSES

Q: "What meetings do I have today?"
A: Spoken natural English summary of today's schedule + suggestions to drill into meetings

Q: "What are my overdue action items?"
A: Lists overdue items with priority and due dates + suggestions per assignee

Q: "Am I free tomorrow afternoon?"
A: Checks calendar for conflicts in that time window

Q: "What did we discuss in the Q4 review?"
A: Semantic search over meeting chunks — returns CFO discussion summary

Q: "Is Bharath available next week?"
A: Checks agenda chunks (Bharath is_board_member=true); indicates if from agenda file

Q: "Tell me about the 1:1 with Bharath."
A: Meeting details + 3-4 follow-up chips: "What were the key decisions from...?",
   "What action items are assigned to Bharath Kumar?", etc.

Q: "Check my inbox"
A: "You have no unread emails" (stub in mock mode; live with Graph API)

